Maintainer: edulution.io <info@netzint.de>
Changed-By: Lukas Spitznagel <lukas.spitznagel@netzint.de>
Description:
 edulution-linbo-vdi - VDI service for linuxmuster.net on Proxmox
Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.1.7) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Running, unassigned clones are probed every 60 s; one that answers on no
     health-check port for livenessTimeout seconds (default 600, 0 disables) is
     marked failed and rebuilt. Before, a clone stuck in the LINBO menu or
     crashed after its build counted as available and was handed to users.
   * vdi-setup names 'linuxmuster-import-devices -s <school>' for schools other
     than default-school: without -s the import regenerates DHCP and LINBO for
     default-school only, so clones of other schools PXE-booted with their old
     group and were rebuilt in a loop. Docs updated.
